  $translations['fr:default']['4477024c594753e63cf2f955519498dc'] = array(
    'source' => 'The name of the field. The form name is not shown to the user but used internally in the HTML code and URLs.
Unless you know what you are doing, it is highly recommended that you prefix the form name with <code>profile_</code> to avoid name clashes with other fields. Spaces or any other special characters except dash (-) and underscore (_) are not allowed. An example name is "profile_favorite_color" or perhaps just "profile_color".',
    'context' => '',
    'location' => '',
    'translation' => 'Le nom du champ. Le nom du formulaire n\'est pas montré à l\'utilisateur, mais utilisé en interne dans le code HTML et les URL.
Sauf si vous savez ce que vous faites, il est fortement recommandé de préfixer le nom du formulaire avec <code>profile_</code>, de manière à éviter des conflits de nommage avec d\'autres champs. Les espaces ou tout autre caractère, à l\'exception du trait d\'union (-) et du tiret bas (_), sont interdits. Exemple de nom : "profile_couleur_favorite" ou plus simplement "profile_couleur".',
    'plid' => 0,
    'plural' => 0,
  );
  $translatables[] = t('The name of the field. The form name is not shown to the user but used internally in the HTML code and URLs.
Unless you know what you are doing, it is highly recommended that you prefix the form name with <code>profile_</code> to avoid name clashes with other fields. Spaces or any other special characters except dash (-) and underscore (_) are not allowed. An example name is "profile_favorite_color" or perhaps just "profile_color".', array(), array('context' => ''));
